# Cool but Rude, level 1: "Whenever you attack, you may discard a card. If you do, draw a card." Turn 1 Bot1 casts
# Ornithopter (free) and the Class (a Mox Ruby and a Mox Jet pay {1}{R}). Turn 3 Bot1 draws Island and attacks with the
# Ornithopter: the trigger asks for a discard as it resolves, Bot1 discards a Mountain and draws Swamp (the next card).
# The discard is no damage at level 1: the second ability exists only from level 2 (CR 716.2a), and the Ornithopter
# has 0 power, so Bot2 stays at 20.

